  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Amplify Open Innovation for Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To apply human-centred design to persistent development challenges in order to source early-stage ideas, especially from small community-based organisations or social enterprises.  This will contribute towards the Global Goals by facilitating open collaboration amongst innovators and by benefitting user groups in low-and middle-income countries to meet their most pressing daily needs (e.g. basic services, personal security, health, employment). The programme will address 8 different development challenges over 6 years.</narrative>
  </description>
